<!--
  Dedicated splash-only vector for the Android 12+ SplashScreen API.

  Unlike the launcher adaptive-icon foreground (which is scaled to fit the
  66dp adaptive-icon safe zone and therefore reads as a boxed app-icon
  plate when the SplashScreen system re-frames it inside its 240dp
  circular mask), this vector scales the Irth mark to fill ~96dp of the
  108dp canvas with no reserved safe-zone padding. The result is a clean
  transparent gold logo on the splash background color — no square plate,
  no rounded-square launcher shape.

  DO NOT reference this drawable from any adaptive-icon (ic_launcher.xml
  etc.) — it intentionally lacks safe-zone padding and will clip inside a
  launcher mask. Launcher icons continue to use ic_launcher_foreground.
-->
